WEBVTT

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:27.020
[sirens blaring]

00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:36.620
[sniffing] Ah-choo!

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:42.420
[Mater] All right, everybody
please keep together now.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:47.260
We is now entering the Doc Hudson
wing of the museum.

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:50.300
Wow. Unbelievable.
That many wins in a single season.

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:54.420
He's the real deal, Junior.
The Hudson Hornet was my inspiration.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:57.980
Excuse me, son.
Is Doc Hudson here today?

00:00:58.060 --> 00:01:01.860
Sorry, Mrs. The King, I think Doc
went out for a drive or somethin'.

00:01:05.180 --> 00:01:08.340
- [Lightning] Whoo! Whoo!
- [Doc] Yeah!

00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:10.940
Well, you sure ain't no dirt boy.

00:01:11.020 --> 00:01:14.060
Not today, old man.
I know all your tricks.

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:16.940
[growls]

00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:20.260
Doc! Doc!

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:22.060
Whoo-ah!

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:24.740
[Doc] Not all my tricks, rookie!

00:01:27.740 --> 00:01:29.740
[all grumble]

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:37.500
[cheering]

00:01:41.340 --> 00:01:44.860
Attention!
Kiss the pavement goodbye.

00:01:44.940 --> 00:01:48.340
When I'm finished, you'll have mud
in places you didn't know you had!

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:52.260
- Yo, I've never been off-road!
- Well, that's gonna change right now!

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:55.420
About face!
Drop and give me 20 miles!

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:57.500
Go! Go!
Go, go, go, go, go! Go!

00:01:57.580 --> 00:02:00.380
Man, now I got dirt in my rims!

00:02:03.020 --> 00:02:05.020
- [pole hits metal]
- Huh? Look at this!

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:07.300
It's my hood! It's my hood!

00:02:07.340 --> 00:02:10.460
I ain't seen this thing in 20 years!

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:15.020
Well, it fits perfectly.
How do I look? Ah-choo!

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:21.980
Oh, dang.

00:02:27.140 --> 00:02:30.620
You are a toy car!

00:02:30.740 --> 00:02:35.500
You are a sad, strange little wagon
and you have my pity. Farewell.

00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:38.660
[Woody Car] Oh, yeah?
Well, good riddance, you loony!

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:42.380
Hey, I hate to break up the road rally,
guys, but they're here!

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:44.820
Birthday guests at three o'clock!

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:48.220
[chuckling] Oh, man! Whoever does
the voice of that piggy truck,

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:50.860
I'm tellin' ya, he's one great actor!

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:55.620
We're banished, genius! Stuck here
in this wasteland without chains!

00:02:55.660 --> 00:02:59.460
But, Mike, the Boomobile's in trouble!
She needs our help!

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:03.820
- You're still not listening! [gasping]
- Ah!

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:07.500
Welcome to the Himalayas!
Snow cone?

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:11.500
Oh, that Abominable Snowplow
is quite the comic thespian!

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:14.020
Just get in there.
Go! Go, go, go!

00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:15.500
Circus cars?

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:18.020
How can you be circus cars?

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:20.660
These are the lousiest
circus cars in the world,

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:22.700
and they're gonna make me rich!

00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:23.900
Wait a minute here.

00:03:23.980 --> 00:03:26.460
They're just usin' the same actor
over and over.

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:29.060
What kind of a cut-rate production
is this?

00:03:32.740 --> 00:03:35.940
[♪ Brad Paisley: Find Yourself]

00:06:52.380 --> 00:06:54.860
[Minny moaning]

00:06:54.900 --> 00:06:59.580
Oh, for the love of Chrysler, can we
please ask someone for directions?

00:06:59.660 --> 00:07:03.900
No! There's an on-ramp close!
I know it! I can feel it!

